        ('Which type of muscle is found in the walls of the heart?', ['Skeletal muscle', 'Smooth muscle', 'Cardiac muscle', 'Voluntary muscle'], 2, 'Cardiac muscle is the specialized, involuntary muscle unique to the heart.'),
